{%- comment -%}
  Section: Lio · Founder Letter
  Quote-mark SVG namespaced to section.id. CSS scoped to .lio-founder.
{%- endcomment -%}

<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  <defs>
    <symbol id="lio-founder-quote-{{ section.id }}" viewBox="0 0 72 54">
      <path d="M 0 54 L 0 28 Q 0 0 24 0 L 24 12 Q 14 12 12 28 L 24 28 L 24 54 Z M 40 54 L 40 28 Q 40 0 64 0 L 64 12 Q 54 12 52 28 L 64 28 L 64 54 Z" fill="currentColor"/>
    </symbol>
  </defs>
</svg>

<section class="lio-founder" id="lio-founder-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="lio-founder__inner">
    <div class="lio-founder__quote-mark">
      <svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#lio-founder-quote-{{ section.id }}"/></svg>
    </div>
    <span class="lio-founder__eyebrow">A note from the founder</span>
    <h2>I built Lio because nothing else worked on me.</h2>
    <p>I tried to quit for years. Patches, gum, cold turkey, apps, books, bets with friends. What I found was that the problem wasn't nicotine — it was the reaching. The 200 times a day my hand went to my mouth, unconsciously, on autopilot. That's what I couldn't break.</p>
    <p>So we built something that replaced the ritual. Not a pharmaceutical, not a shortcut, not a half-measure. Just the same motion, the same breath, the same small moment of pause — made of natural essential oils, with nothing in it you wouldn't want in your body.</p>
    <p>Over 100,000 people have used Lio since. Some quit smoking. Some quit vaping. Some stopped biting their nails, or stress-eating, or fidgeting in meetings. The point was never the thing they were quitting. The point was giving the ritual somewhere better to go.</p>
    <div class="lio-founder__sig">
      <div class="lio-founder__sig-avatar">MvL</div>
      <div>
        <div class="lio-founder__sig-name">Mees van Lier</div>
        <div class="lio-founder__sig-title">Founder, Lio® · Writing from Bali</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .lio-founder {
    --lfo-forest: var(--lio-forest, #0b2410);
    --lfo-chalk:  var(--lio-chalk, #fcfefb);
    --lfo-mint:   var(--lio-mint, #94fca9);
    --lfo-f-10:   var(--lio-f-10, rgba(11, 36, 16, 0.10));
    --lfo-f-55:   var(--lio-f-55, rgba(11, 36, 16, 0.55));
    --lfo-f-72:   var(--lio-f-72, rgba(11, 36, 16, 0.72));

    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 40px 80px;
    font-family: "sofia-pro", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .lio-founder__inner {
    background: #f3f6f0;
    border: 1px solid var(--lfo-f-10);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 56px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .lio-founder__quote-mark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 28px; left: 44px;
    width: 60px; height: 50px;
    color: var(--lfo-mint);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .lio-founder__quote-mark svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

  .lio-founder__eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--lfo-f-55);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .lio-founder__eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 22px; height: 1px; background: var(--lfo-forest); }

  .lio-founder__inner h2 {
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.8vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--lfo-forest);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 740px;
  }
  .lio-founder__inner p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--lfo-f-72);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .lio-founder__sig {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--lfo-f-10);
  }
  .lio-founder__sig-avatar {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--lfo-forest);
    color: var(--lfo-mint);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .lio-founder__sig-name  { font-weight: 700; color: var(--lfo-forest); font-size: 15px; }
  .lio-founder__sig-title { font-size: 13px; color: var(--lfo-f-55); margin-top: 2px; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .lio-founder { padding: 32px 20px 56px; }
    .lio-founder__inner { padding: 48px 28px 40px; }
    .lio-founder__quote-mark { top: 20px; left: 20px; width: 44px; height: 36px; }
    .lio-founder__eyebrow { margin-top: 32px; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Lio · Founder",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-lio-founder",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Lio · Founder" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
